{"seq":4,"slug":"refactoring-with-regex","title":"正则重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/practical-patterns/refactoring-with-regex","wordCount":649,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"正则重构\">正则重构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>正则重构利用查找替换的正则能力，批量完成 API 迁移、命名规范统一与代码模式升级等机械性改动。它的杠杆极大，风险也极高——一个错误的替换可能破坏大量代码，因此<strong>安全流程与替换模式同等重要</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>主战场是编辑器内置的正则替换（如 VS Code Ctrl+Shift+H）与 <code>rg</code> + <code>sed</code> 的命令行批处理。</li>\n<li>典型场景：<code>require→import</code>、<code>fetch→api 封装</code>、命名风格互转、<code>var→const</code>。</li>\n<li>铁律：重构前先 Git 提交，先预览匹配结果，小范围验证后再批量替换，最后跑类型检查与测试套件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"编辑器中的正则替换\">编辑器中的正则替换</h2><p>现代代码编辑器（VS Code、JetBrains IDE 等）内置了强大的正则查找替换功能，是批量代码重构的高效工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"查找：console\\.log\\((.+?)\\)&#10;替换：logger.debug($1)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>查找：console\\.log\\((.+?)\\)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>替换：logger.debug($1)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"查找：import \\{ (.+?) \\} from [&#39;&quot;]lodash[&#39;&quot;]&#10;替换：import { $1 } from &#39;lodash-es&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>查找：import \\{ (.+?) \\} from ['\"]lodash['\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>替换：import { $1 } from 'lodash-es'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编辑器</th>\n<th>正则引擎</th>\n<th>捕获组引用</th>\n<th>多文件支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VS Code</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td><code>$1</code> <code>$2</code></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JetBrains</td>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td><code>$1</code> <code>$2</code></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vim</td>\n<td>Vim regex</td>\n<td><code>\\1</code> <code>\\2</code></td>\n<td>手动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sublime</td>\n<td>PCRE/Boost</td>\n<td><code>$1</code> <code>\\1</code></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    EDITOR[&quot;编辑器正则替换&quot;] --&gt; FIND[&quot;查找面板&quot;]&#10;    FIND --&gt; REGEX[&quot;启用正则模式&quot;]&#10;    REGEX --&gt; SCOPE[&quot;选择范围&quot;]&#10;    SCOPE --&gt; FILE[&quot;当前文件&quot;]&#10;    SCOPE --&gt; PROJECT[&quot;整个项目&quot;]&#10;    SCOPE --&gt; SELECTION[&quot;选中区域&quot;]&#10;    FILE --&gt; PREVIEW[&quot;预览替换&quot;]&#10;    PROJECT --&gt; PREVIEW&#10;    PREVIEW --&gt; APPLY[&quot;确认应用&quot;]\">graph TD\n    EDITOR[\"编辑器正则替换\"] --&gt; FIND[\"查找面板\"]\n    FIND --&gt; REGEX[\"启用正则模式\"]\n    REGEX --&gt; SCOPE[\"选择范围\"]\n    SCOPE --&gt; FILE[\"当前文件\"]\n    SCOPE --&gt; PROJECT[\"整个项目\"]\n    SCOPE --&gt; SELECTION[\"选中区域\"]\n    FILE --&gt; PREVIEW[\"预览替换\"]\n    PROJECT --&gt; PREVIEW\n    PREVIEW --&gt; APPLY[\"确认应用\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> VS Code 的正则替换支持 <code>\\n</code> 匹配换行符和 <code>$1</code> 引用捕获组。在&quot;在文件中替换&quot;（Ctrl+Shift+H）中启用正则模式，可以进行项目范围的批量重构。替换前务必使用 Git 确保代码可回滚。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"api-迁移\">API 迁移</h2><p>当项目需要从旧 API 迁移到新 API 时，正则替换可以自动化大部分机械性工作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const oldCode = `&#10;const result = await fetch(&#39;/api/users&#39;);&#10;const data = await result.json();&#10;`;&#10;&#10;oldCode.replace(&#10;  /const\\s+(\\w+)\\s*=\\s*await\\s+fetch\\(([^)]+)\\);\\s*\\nconst\\s+(\\w+)\\s*=\\s*await\\s+\\1\\.json\\(\\);/g,&#10;  &#39;const $3 = await api.get($2);&#39;,&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> oldCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">const result = await fetch('/api/users');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">const data = await result.json();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">oldCode.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">fetch</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">)]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+\\1</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">json</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\(\\)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'const $3 = await api.get($2);'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"查找：this\\.setState\\(\\{[\\s\\n]*(\\w+):\\s*(.+?)[\\s\\n]*\\}\\)&#10;替换：this.state.$1 = $2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>查找：this\\.setState\\(\\{[\\s\\n]*(\\w+):\\s*(.+?)[\\s\\n]*\\}\\)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>替换：this.state.$1 = $2</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>迁移场景</th>\n<th>查找模式</th>\n<th>替换模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>fetch → api 封装</td>\n<td><code>fetch\\((.+?)\\)</code></td>\n<td><code>api.get($1)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>setState → 赋值</td>\n<td><code>setState\\(\\{(\\w+): (.+?)\\}\\)</code></td>\n<td><code>state.$1 = $2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>require → import</td>\n<td><code>const (\\w+) = require\\(&#39;(.+?)&#39;\\)</code></td>\n<td><code>import $1 from &#39;$2&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>callback → async</td>\n<td><code>\\.then\\((\\w+) =&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>const $1 = await</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"rg -l &#39;require\\(&#39; src/ --type js | xargs sed -i &#39;&#39; &quot;s/const \\(\\w\\+\\) = require(&#39;\\([^&#39;]*\\)&#39;)/import \\1 from &#39;\\2&#39;/g&quot;&#10;&#10;find src -name &#39;*.js&#39; -exec sed -i &#39;&#39; &#39;s/\\.forEach(/\\.map(/g&#39; {} +\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'require\\('</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> js</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"s/const \\(\\w\\+\\) = require('\\([^']*\\)')/import \\1 from '\\2'/g\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '*.js'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/\\.forEach(/\\.map(/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"命名规范统一\">命名规范统一</h2><p>正则替换是统一代码命名规范的最佳工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function camelToSnake(str) {&#10;  return str&#10;    .replace(/([A-Z])/g, &#39;_$1&#39;)&#10;    .toLowerCase()&#10;    .replace(/^_/, &#39;&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function snakeToCamel(str) {&#10;  return str.replace(/_([a-z])/g, (_, c) =&gt; c.toUpperCase());&#10;}&#10;&#10;function kebabToPascal(str) {&#10;  return str.replace(/(^|-)([a-z])/g, (_, _sep, c) =&gt; c.toUpperCase());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> camelToSnake</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[A-Z]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'_$1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B39