pan style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"安全与回滚\">安全与回滚</h2><p>正则重构的威力也伴随着风险。一个错误的替换可能破坏大量代码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全措施</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>必要性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Git 提交</td>\n<td>重构前先提交</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预览</td>\n<td>先查看匹配结果</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小范围测试</td>\n<td>先在单个文件验证</td>\n<td>强烈建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>替换后运行 typecheck</td>\n<td>强烈建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试套件</td>\n<td>替换后运行全部测试</td>\n<td>强烈建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审查差异</td>\n<td><code>git diff</code> 检查所有改动</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git add -A &amp;&amp; git commit -m &quot;before regex refactor&quot;&#10;&#10;rg &#39;oldPattern&#39; --type js --count&#10;&#10;rg &#39;oldPattern&#39; --type js -l | head -1 | xargs sed -i &#39;&#39; &#39;s/oldPattern/newPattern/g&#39;&#10;&#10;git diff&#10;&#10;rg &#39;oldPattern&#39; --type js -l | xargs sed -i &#39;&#39; &#39;s/oldPattern/newPattern/g&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"before regex refactor\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'oldPattern'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> js</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'oldPattern'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> js</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/oldPattern/newPattern/g'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'oldPattern'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> js</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/oldPattern/newPattern/g'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    START[&quot;开始重构&quot;] --&gt; COMMIT[&quot;Git 提交当前状态&quot;]&#10;    COMMIT --&gt; PREVIEW[&quot;预览匹配结果&quot;]&#10;    PREVIEW --&gt; TEST[&quot;单文件测试&quot;]&#10;    TEST --&gt; BATCH[&quot;批量替换&quot;]&#10;    BATCH --&gt; DIFF[&quot;检查 git diff&quot;]&#10;    DIFF --&gt; CHECK[&quot;运行类型检查和测试&quot;]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|通过| DONE[&quot;完成&quot;]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|失败| ROLLBACK[&quot;git checkout 回滚&quot;]&#10;    ROLLBACK --&gt; FIX[&quot;修正正则后重试&quot;]&#10;    FIX --&gt; TEST\">graph TD\n    START[\"开始重构\"] --&gt; COMMIT[\"Git 提交当前状态\"]\n    COMMIT --&gt; PREVIEW[\"预览匹配结果\"]\n    PREVIEW --&gt; TEST[\"单文件测试\"]\n    TEST --&gt; BATCH[\"批量替换\"]\n    BATCH --&gt; DIFF[\"检查 git diff\"]\n    DIFF --&gt; CHECK[\"运行类型检查和测试\"]\n    CHECK --&gt;|通过| DONE[\"完成\"]\n    CHECK --&gt;|失败| ROLLBACK[\"git checkout 回滚\"]\n    ROLLBACK --&gt; FIX[\"修正正则后重试\"]\n    FIX --&gt; TEST</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((正则重构))&#10;    编辑器替换&#10;      VS Code 正则模式&#10;      多文件范围&#10;      预览确认&#10;    API 迁移&#10;      fetch → 封装&#10;      require → import&#10;      callback → async&#10;    命名统一&#10;      驼峰 ↔ 蛇形&#10;      kebab ↔ Pascal&#10;      VS Code 修饰符&#10;    模式升级&#10;      var → const&#10;      函数 → 箭头&#10;      拼接 → 模板&#10;    安全措施&#10;      Git 先提交&#10;      小范围测试&#10;      类型检查&#10;      测试套件\">mindmap\n  root((正则重构))\n    编辑器替换\n      VS Code 正则模式\n      多文件范围\n      预览确认\n    API 迁移\n      fetch → 封装\n      require → import\n      callback → async\n    命名统一\n      驼峰 ↔ 蛇形\n      kebab ↔ Pascal\n      VS Code 修饰符\n    模式升级\n      var → const\n      函数 → 箭头\n      拼接 → 模板\n    安全措施\n      Git 先提交\n      小范围测试\n      类型检查\n      测试套件</pre><ul>\n<li>编辑器内置的正则替换（VS Code Ctrl+Shift+H）是最常用的批量重构工具。</li>\n<li><strong>API 迁移</strong>通过正则替换自动化 <code>require→import</code>、<code>fetch→api</code> 等机械性工作。</li>\n<li><strong>命名风格转换</strong>（camelCase↔snake_case↔kebab-case）可以用正则精确实现。</li>\n<li><strong>代码模式升级</strong>（var→const、函数→箭头函数）适合用正则批量处理。</li>\n<li>正则重构前<strong>必须先 Git 提交</strong>，替换后运行类型检查和测试套件验证正确性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"正则重构","id":"正则重构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"编辑器中的正则替换","id":"编辑器中的正则替换"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"API 迁移","id":"api-迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"命名规范统一","id":"命名规范统一"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"代码模式升级","id":"代码模式升级"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"安全与回滚","id":"安全与回滚"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"日志解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/practical-patterns/log-parsing"},"next":null}